OL,3,GNEWSAFake bomb vest teen jailed for
OL,4,Aterrorism offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 19-year-old man who shared an online
OL,7,Fvideo of himself wearing a fake bomb
OL,8,Fvest has been jailed for nine years and
OL,9,Fsix months for terrorism offences.
OL,11,FMohammed Khalil Nadir, from
OL,12,FMiddlesborough, was found guilty of
OL,13,Fpossessing articles for a terrorist
OL,14,Fpurpose and disseminating terrorist
OL,15,Fpublications after a trial at Leeds
OL,16,FCrown Court in June.
OL,18,FNadir, who had researched the
OL,19,FManchester synagogue attack, was
OL,20,Farrested in October 2025 following an
OL,21,Finvestigation by Counter Terrorism
OL,22,FPolicing North East (CTPNE).
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
